Our coming of age has come and gone.

2
00:11:46,666 --> 00:11:52,666
Folklore: The Long Pond Studio Sessions is a music,
documentary film directed by Taylor Swift.

3
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:46,000
An intimate concert film, in which Taylor Swift performs each song from her album 'folklore' in order,
as she reveals the meaning and the stories behind all 17 tracks for the very first time.

4
